  "description": "Deluxe Cowboy is a bold and rugged display font inspired by classic Western typography and vintage cowboy aesthetics. With its strong serifs, distressed texture, and retro flair, this font perfectly captures the spirit of the Wild West.\nIdeal for posters, logos, apparel designs, signage, branding, and any project that needs a rustic, masculine, and old-school Western touch. Whether you’re creating a saloon-style design or a modern western theme, Deluxe Cowboy brings authenticity and character to your work.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Deluxe Cowboy is a bold and rugged display font inspired by classic Western typography and vintage cowboy aesthetics. With its strong serifs, distressed texture, and retro flair, this font perfectly captures the spirit of the Wild West.</p>\n<p>Ideal for posters, logos, apparel designs, signage, branding, and any project that needs a rustic, masculine, and old-school Western touch. Whether you’re creating a saloon-style design or a modern western theme, Deluxe Cowboy brings authenticity and character to your work.</p>",
